  "scope": "A common upper barrier and logarithmically corrected order give a compactness criterion for positive endpoint admission and mass collapse at excluded positive endpoints. Greatest solutions converge from the right at every admitted positive exponent in L1 and capacity, with total-variation convergence of equation measures. Intrinsic density criteria, actual excluded-endpoint examples and left continuity remain unresolved.",
